      "content": "it just feels like i'm fighting a losing battle every single day. like, people always say things get better or there's a purpose to the struggle, but looking at the physics of it... it just feels like a lie we tell ourselves to ignore reality. if the outcome is guaranteed, isn't all this effort just unnecessary pain?",
